  "beats": [
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "As the article records, on 2 November 2026 de Miguel suffered a blunt cardiac injury in a collision with FC Andorra goalkeeper Jesús Owono, which caused him to go into cardiac arrest.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1383799981:26"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "After his death, the village of Navahermosa declared three days of official mourning, and his funeral was planned for 5 November.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1383799981:32"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "Jesús de Miguel Alameda, who was born on 21 September 1996 and died on 3 November 2026, was a Spanish professional footballer who played as a striker.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1383799981:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "Jesús de Miguel Alameda was born on 21 September 1996 in Madrid.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q116992476:P569",
        "wd:Q116992476:P19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "He played for 8 clubs from 2015 to 2026, moving from CD Leganés B to C.D. Tenerife.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q116992476:P54:Q9196665",
        "wd:Q116992476:P54:Q9008987",
        "wd:Q116992476:P54:Q108708",
        "wd:Q116992476:P54:Q4651246",
        "wd:Q116992476:P54:Q840620",
        "wd:Q116992476:P54:Q20278773",
        "wd:Q116992476:P54:Q743557",
        "wd:Q116992476:P54:Q216661"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:43Z",
      "text": "He died on 3 November 2026 at Hospital Universitario Nuestra Señora de Candelaria, aged 30.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q116992476:P570",
        "wd:Q116992476:P20",
        "wd:Q116992476:P569"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:01:00Z",
      "text": "English Wikipedia recorded 224,585 readers of the article on 4 November 2026, while in the weeks before it normally drew a median of 4 a day.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Jesús_de_Miguel:2026-11-04",
        "views:en:Jesús_de_Miguel:prior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:01:07Z",
      "text": "The article was read in 11 languages, and after English, Spanish had the most readers at 67,167.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Jesús_de_Miguel:2026-11-04",
        "views:es:Jesús_de_Miguel_Alameda:2026-11-04"
      ]
    },
